WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:06.170
Mother, I attempted to sneak into the party

00:06.200 --> 00:09.290
to find out who was pretending to be me.

00:10.140 --> 00:11.360
It was Rosemary!

00:12.470 --> 00:16.410
She deceived me and tore your dress to pieces!

00:25.490 --> 00:26.780
NAAJA

00:25.490 --> 00:26.780
Nadja,

00:26.900 --> 00:29.450
With your eyes

00:26.900 --> 00:29.450
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:29.450 --> 00:30.660
Nadja,

00:29.450 --> 00:30.660
NAAJA

00:30.700 --> 00:32.950
What do you see?

00:30.700 --> 00:32.950
Nani ga mieru

00:32.990 --> 00:35.870
Shining in the far distance,

00:32.990 --> 00:35.870
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:35.870 --> 00:38.250
The door to the future,

00:35.870 --> 00:38.250
Mirai no tobira

00:39.170 --> 00:42.630
That's what I'm searching for

00:39.170 --> 00:42.630
Sagashite iru

00:42.630 --> 00:49.840
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:50.550 --> 00:54.060
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:50.550 --> 00:54.060
Minna egao de aetara

00:54.140 --> 00:57.390
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:54.140 --> 00:57.390
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:57.430 --> 01:00.650
It could be so much more fun

00:57.430 --> 01:00.650
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:00.690 --> 01:04.110
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:00.690 --> 01:04.110
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:04.480 --> 01:07.780
I can't see the end of the journey

01:04.480 --> 01:07.780
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:07.900 --> 01:11.240
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:07.900 --> 01:11.240
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:11.410 --> 01:14.990
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:11.410 --> 01:14.990
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.040 --> 01:17.160
I will go waving

01:15.040 --> 01:17.160
Te wo furinagara

01:17.250 --> 01:23.920
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:17.250 --> 01:23.920
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:23.960 --> 01:26.670
But I won't look back

01:23.960 --> 01:26.670
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.010 --> 01:31.970
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.010 --> 01:31.970
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:32.260 --> 01:35.680
Nadja, Your smile

01:32.260 --> 01:35.680
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:35.760 --> 01:39.100
Nadja, gives me courage

01:35.760 --> 01:39.100
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:39.140 --> 01:42.060
Under the blue sky,

01:39.140 --> 01:42.060
Aoi sora no shita de

01:42.190 --> 01:45.020
I will find the place

01:42.190 --> 01:45.020
Ashita no yukue

01:45.320 --> 01:49.240
where my future lies

01:45.320 --> 01:49.240
Mitsukeru kara

02:00.910 --> 02:02.420
﻿Isn't Nadja back yet?

02:02.420 --> 02:03.920
﻿She'll be back soon.

02:04.250 --> 02:08.670
﻿But she's pretty late, isn't she? It's been a while since she went out...

02:09.510 --> 02:11.340
﻿Oh, it's raining..

02:14.510 --> 02:15.640
﻿Sorry!

02:17.010 --> 02:17.970
﻿Rosemary...

02:19.560 --> 02:20.890
﻿Rosemary...

02:21.770 --> 02:22.980
﻿Rosemary...

02:25.060 --> 02:26.310
﻿Nadja!

02:32.070 --> 02:33.910
﻿Where is she?

02:34.570 --> 02:35.410
﻿Here you go.

02:37.080 --> 02:38.120
﻿Does it look good on me?

02:38.740 --> 02:39.910
It does! It does!

02:40.370 --> 02:41.370
﻿Rosemary...

02:42.580 --> 02:44.330
﻿You were part of my family...

02:45.210 --> 02:48.040
﻿...we've always been together in Applefield...!

02:50.010 --> 02:51.970
﻿How could you do such a thing?

02:53.010 --> 02:54.260
﻿How could you?!

02:54.260 --> 02:55.180
﻿Nadja...

02:57.550 --> 02:59.010
﻿What's the matter?!

02:59.600 --> 03:00.520
What happened?!

03:02.980 --> 03:04.230
﻿Rosemary...

03:04.270 --> 03:04.810
﻿What?

03:05.440 --> 03:08.440
﻿Rosemary is the fake!

03:08.940 --> 03:11.610
﻿Rosemary's the maid we met in Spain, right?

03:11.690 --> 03:13.900
﻿Nadja's old friend...

03:13.950 --> 03:15.410
﻿in Applefield...

03:20.080 --> 03:21.120
﻿Your dress!

03:21.540 --> 03:23.160
﻿What a catastrophe!

03:28.710 --> 03:34.200
Don't Steal Her -- My Mother!

03:34.340 --> 03:36.840
﻿Da...Damn it! Nadja's already at Vienna.

03:37.220 --> 03:41.350
﻿And why the hell does she have that brooch back? Damn!

03:41.350 --> 03:44.520
﻿Rosemary, if only you had stolen it back then...!

03:46.650 --> 03:48.650
﻿Who is Rosemary?

03:49.110 --> 03:53.150
﻿Please don't make a mistake, I am Nadja Preminger.

03:53.240 --> 03:57.160
﻿I couldn't get the brooch back, but it's fine the way it is...

03:57.410 --> 04:01.160
﻿because it will only cause her trouble.

04:01.740 --> 04:02.740
﻿What?

04:02.790 --> 04:05.790
﻿You don't even understand that, do you Uncle?

04:07.920 --> 04:11.500
﻿It was good that I got rid of her dress.

04:12.300 --> 04:15.970
﻿You should've stolen it, not rip it.

04:16.090 --> 04:20.260
﻿If we made it that you had it all this time it would've been a strong evidence.

04:20.970 --> 04:25.810
﻿Uncle, you always lose because you're too greedy.

04:26.230 --> 04:27.890
﻿Why you little--

04:28.020 --> 04:33.980
﻿If I said that I had the dress all the time, what would Grandfather think?

04:34.110 --> 04:36.490
﻿Why didn't she mention it earlier?

04:36.700 --> 04:39.070
﻿He'd only be doubtful, wouldn't he.

04:41.320 --> 04:42.660
﻿D-Damn..

04:42.660 --> 04:45.950
﻿But the real game is tomorrow morning.

04:46.870 --> 04:52.130
﻿Of course. The separated mother and her child will meet tearfully at last...

04:52.130 --> 04:53.210
﻿Do well.

04:53.300 --> 04:54.670
﻿No need to worry.

04:54.670 --> 04:59.010
﻿I have the feeling that I will be loved by mother Colette.

05:01.510 --> 05:06.680
﻿Drink up slowly, dear. The chamomile and lavender tea will make you relax.

05:07.180 --> 05:08.560
﻿Thanks. Granny.

05:09.100 --> 05:11.270
﻿I'm sorry I gave you all trouble...

05:11.440 --> 05:12.400
﻿Don't be silly!

05:13.320 --> 05:16.860
﻿Why are you being polite? Cheer up!

05:16.900 --> 05:18.820
﻿It'll be fine. Nadja.

05:18.990 --> 05:20.910
It's going to be all right!

05:24.830 --> 05:26.200
﻿That's right.

05:26.490 --> 05:30.460
﻿I should start thinking about what to do from now on, not worrying about the past.

05:31.210 --> 05:36.460
﻿I don't think there'll be a problem either. Nadja has her brooch, the diary,

05:37.340 --> 05:40.050
﻿and although ripped, her mother's dress..

05:40.300 --> 05:44.180
﻿It's enough evidence to prove that Nadja's the real one.

05:44.890 --> 05:45.760
Right.

05:46.390 --> 05:49.230
﻿Let's go and meet the Duke Preminger in person-

05:49.230 --> 05:50.390
﻿That's not good.

05:52.100 --> 05:53.020
﻿Harvey!

05:54.560 --> 06:01.700
﻿So... Herman fooled the journalist who wanted to confirm Harvey's article.

06:02.320 --> 06:03.570
﻿No, that's not it.

06:03.780 --> 06:07.540
﻿Just now I was with that journalist to correct him.

06:07.660 --> 06:11.790
﻿He said the one who convinced him that the Black Rose stole the brooch was...

06:12.080 --> 06:15.090
﻿this self-proclaimed Nadja.

06:15.340 --> 06:18.960
﻿Wait! You're talking about Rosemary, right?

06:19.090 --> 06:21.970
﻿But she was Nadja's childhood friend and they were good friends...

06:22.010 --> 06:26.430
﻿Then why, why would she do such a thing to Nadja?

06:28.890 --> 06:32.520
﻿Sorry Nadja... It went like this all because of me.

06:32.940 --> 06:37.360
﻿No! You helped me in getting the brooch back!

06:37.360 --> 06:40.990
﻿That's right! The brooch came back safely!

06:41.190 --> 06:42.450
﻿It's not like this!

06:43.150 --> 06:47.080
﻿Any one who doesn't know what really happened will think that...

06:47.410 --> 06:52.250
﻿The Black Rose stole the brooch from Duke Preminger's grandchild. Nadja.

06:52.370 --> 06:56.790
﻿And the girl who is wearing saying that she is Nadja...

06:56.920 --> 07:02.050
﻿Which means, you, who have the brooch, are a fake Nadja.

07:03.260 --> 07:08.350
﻿But this is my brooch! I had it with me since I was a born!

07:08.350 --> 07:16.060
﻿If we say that Nadja had it before, then they'll know that Rosemary is lying!

07:16.100 --> 07:20.530
﻿It's frustrating, but they won't believe what we say.

07:20.570 --> 07:27.740
﻿That right. It's sad, we're just humble itinerant performers, and Herman's a noble aristocrat.

07:27.820 --> 07:33.200
﻿It's nonsense, but people will believe the aristocrats, not the performers.

07:33.200 --> 07:36.540
﻿Nadja, stop wearing the brooch for a while.

07:37.630 --> 07:39.460
I ﻿agree.

07:39.460 --> 07:40.300
Harvey?

07:40.750 --> 07:43.260
﻿I don't intend to withdraw like this.

07:43.630 --> 07:46.550
﻿I'm planning to seek revenge...

07:47.180 --> 07:51.720
﻿even if it means putting my pride as a journalist at stake, I'm going to give Herman a good scare.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.770
﻿Anyway, don't lose hope.

07:58.190 --> 08:00.230
﻿Mother...

08:02.650 --> 08:03.690
﻿Nadja...

08:11.620 --> 08:15.580
﻿Father! Where is Nadja!? Let me meet her!

08:18.120 --> 08:21.540
﻿During the 13 years after losing Nadja...

08:21.920 --> 08:27.130
﻿I thought you'd known how hard it was for me...

08:28.220 --> 08:29.090
I...

08:29.800 --> 08:35.390
﻿kept blaming myself. I had let Nadja die.

08:35.390 --> 08:39.520
﻿If I had been more careful, my precious daughter..

08:39.810 --> 08:42.730
﻿wouldn't have gotten sick and I wouldn't have lost her

08:44.530 --> 08:51.490
﻿You told a horrible lie to me! You didn't even care about me!

08:52.200 --> 08:58.670
﻿At that time, saying that Nadja died was the best plan for the House of Preminger.

08:59.790 --> 09:04.170
﻿Colette... Because of that you got to live happily.

09:06.920 --> 09:09.050
﻿When can I see Nadja?

09:09.550 --> 09:12.300
﻿Tomorrow morning, Herman will bring her here.

09:12.390 --> 09:14.720
﻿Then after that, Nadja will be taken care of by me-

09:14.720 --> 09:17.680
Colette. Don't be mistaken.

09:17.680 --> 09:24.730
﻿Nadja is no longer your child. She's now our important heiress.

09:24.900 --> 09:26.610
﻿But Father!

09:27.240 --> 09:28.780
﻿This conversation is over.

09:38.200 --> 09:39.290
﻿Mother..

09:40.420 --> 09:44.790
﻿That dress was an important bond between Mother and me...

09:50.430 --> 09:53.140
﻿The dress wasn't the only thing you ripped...

09:53.140 --> 09:56.310
﻿You tore my feelings for Mother as well

09:57.020 --> 10:01.310
﻿I can't ever forgive you Rosemary... I won't forgive you...!

10:01.810 --> 10:05.570
﻿Mother...! What should I do?

10:29.420 --> 10:32.590
﻿Though Granny and Harvey told me not to wear the brooch...

10:33.680 --> 10:38.720
﻿This brooch is a bond! It's an precious thing that connects me and my mother!

10:41.230 --> 10:44.150
﻿I can't take off this brooch!

10:49.320 --> 10:52.150
﻿I'm going to the House of Preminger.

10:52.530 --> 10:55.370
Mother, I'm going to meet you soon...

10:55.370 --> 10:58.330
﻿So please don't be fooled by that fake!

11:04.420 --> 11:05.630
﻿She's...

11:06.170 --> 11:08.630
﻿Yes sister, it's Nadja.

11:09.960 --> 11:11.130
﻿Is it Nadja?

11:14.090 --> 11:15.180
﻿Mother...!

11:15.510 --> 11:17.220
﻿Mother!

11:19.100 --> 11:22.730
﻿Mother. I'm Nadja! I am Nadja!

11:23.310 --> 11:27.190
﻿Mother, mother, my mother!

11:28.980 --> 11:30.110
﻿Nadja...

11:30.400 --> 11:34.320
﻿my precious Nadja, my cute little daughter...

11:42.330 --> 11:46.670
﻿Nadja, was always thinking of you.

11:47.420 --> 11:52.170
﻿I bought one and put it here for each of your birthdays. ...

11:54.720 --> 12:00.390
﻿Even though people said it's useless to count a dead child's age...

12:01.510 --> 12:02.770
﻿I'm happy...

12:03.430 --> 12:07.690
﻿From now on. I can celebrate your birthday with you.

12:07.980 --> 12:08.940
﻿Nadja.

12:09.020 --> 12:10.520
﻿Yes, Mother.

12:10.900 --> 12:17.530
﻿How about doing a party for your birthday now? For those 13 years we couldn't celebrate...

12:18.610 --> 12:19.950
g﻿ive me your hand.

12:22.580 --> 12:26.460
﻿Nadja, happy 1st birthday.

12:28.620 --> 12:32.460
﻿Nadja, happy 2nd birthday.

12:34.670 --> 12:38.680
﻿Nadja? happy 3rd birthday.

12:40.600 --> 12:41.930
﻿Nadja, Nadja.

12:41.930 --> 12:43.100
﻿Nadja. Nadja.

12:45.730 --> 12:46.850
﻿Nadja.

12:48.600 --> 12:49.730
﻿Nadja.

12:53.780 --> 12:55.030
﻿Nadja.

12:56.610 --> 12:58.650
﻿Mother, let's stop.

12:59.740 --> 13:01.490
﻿What's the matter. Nadja?

13:01.530 --> 13:06.790
﻿I'll be in trouble if I celebrate them all in one day...

13:07.580 --> 13:09.500
﻿I'll become a grandma!

13:10.830 --> 13:11.920
﻿My!

13:13.090 --> 13:18.470
﻿Okay, let's not. I'll be in trouble too if you become a grandma.

13:18.720 --> 13:21.680
﻿Then let's take a walk in the garden, shall we?

13:25.180 --> 13:27.390
﻿This is the House of Preminger...

13:27.930 --> 13:29.770
﻿What a splendid mansion!

13:30.690 --> 13:33.020
﻿My mother might be here.

13:33.900 --> 13:35.400
﻿Who are you?

13:35.980 --> 13:38.860
﻿I came to see Duke Preminger.

13:38.860 --> 13:39.950
﻿What?

13:40.150 --> 13:43.910
﻿Please tell him that the real Nadja is here.

13:43.990 --> 13:47.790
﻿Stop lying! Lady Nadja is already in the mansion.

13:48.290 --> 13:52.630
﻿No she is not! that Nadja is fake! Please!

13:52.630 --> 13:53.630
﻿Go away!

13:53.630 --> 13:58.170
﻿This place isn't for the likes of you to come to. If you don't hurry, I'll call the police.

14:02.090 --> 14:03.550
﻿Did something happen?

14:03.680 --> 14:07.140
﻿No, just some girl calling herself Nadja...

14:07.140 --> 14:07.930
﻿What?!

14:08.100 --> 14:14.020
﻿Master Herman has ordered us to call the police if a girl naming herself Nadja comes here.

14:17.650 --> 14:18.730
﻿Right...

14:21.700 --> 14:23.240
﻿Hurry, hurry!

14:25.740 --> 14:26.620
﻿Rosemary.

14:26.780 --> 14:29.950
﻿There are some Christmas Roses here too! Mother!

14:30.120 --> 14:31.500
﻿Mother?

14:33.080 --> 14:36.500
﻿That person... that person is my mother?

14:36.500 --> 14:38.880
﻿Nadja, you run fast.

14:40.090 --> 14:43.470
﻿My! There's a leaf in your hair.

14:49.680 --> 14:54.150
﻿The person I met that time in Rome... she is... she is...

14:56.270 --> 14:58.020
﻿my mother?

15:00.030 --> 15:02.400
﻿Mother... Mother...!

15:05.740 --> 15:07.490
﻿Mother!!!

15:14.620 --> 15:17.130
﻿Mother! Mother!

15:18.840 --> 15:20.130
﻿Mother!!!

15:31.390 --> 15:34.440
﻿Mother, no! I'm right here!

15:37.310 --> 15:40.980
﻿No! Mother wait! Don't go!

15:42.610 --> 15:45.400
﻿No, wait! Don't go!

15:45.400 --> 15:46.950
﻿Mother!

15:47.240 --> 15:49.030
﻿Mother!!!

15:55.370 --> 16:01.550
﻿I-I'm never going to give up. Because my mother is so close.

16:02.300 --> 16:05.340
﻿My! There's a monkey I've never seen

16:06.090 --> 16:09.470
﻿Or maybe that's one of your tricks as a traveling performer?

16:10.640 --> 16:14.680
﻿Rosemary! Why do you do such horrible things by pretending to be me?!

16:14.810 --> 16:16.140
﻿What are you talking about?

16:17.730 --> 16:20.690
﻿I'm the real Nadja Preminger.

16:21.110 --> 16:25.780
﻿I don't need a girl that was with me at the orphanage to complain against me.

16:26.320 --> 16:28.860
﻿Rosemary! That's enough

16:30.450 --> 16:32.830
﻿I'm not going to forgive you...ever!

16:33.540 --> 16:39.210
﻿Oh, I remember, You used to play as my loyal knight when we were little, right?

16:39.670 --> 16:40.540
Fine.

16:41.790 --> 16:45.300
﻿You can touch your beloved princess.

16:45.340 --> 16:46.720
﻿Rosemary!

16:48.970 --> 16:52.640
﻿Please Rosemary... Stop doing these things.

16:53.390 --> 16:54.350
﻿Nadja.

16:56.480 --> 16:59.230
﻿You really are an innocent girl.

17:00.900 --> 17:02.230
﻿Someone!

17:02.770 --> 17:04.730
﻿Someone! Please help me!

17:05.480 --> 17:06.190
﻿Over there!

17:06.190 --> 17:07.320
﻿Hurry!

17:07.530 --> 17:09.240
﻿Hey!! What do you think you're doing?!

17:09.240 --> 17:10.950
﻿You...! Let go!

17:10.990 --> 17:12.200
Are you alright?

17:11.870 --> 17:12.780
﻿Lady Nadja

17:12.780 --> 17:14.240
﻿Yes? It was so frightening.

17:14.580 --> 17:15.660
﻿That's not right!

17:17.200 --> 17:18.750
﻿Rosemary, you...!

17:18.830 --> 17:21.210
﻿Silence! I am from the Collorades.

17:21.210 --> 17:25.210
﻿Mister Herman's reported a burglary to the police concerning the stolen brooch.

17:25.420 --> 17:27.010
﻿It's-it's not that!

17:27.630 --> 17:28.720
﻿This has been mine since--

17:28.720 --> 17:33.390
﻿It's my brooch! Please get back my brooch!

17:36.270 --> 17:37.730
﻿The girl's a thief!

17:37.890 --> 17:42.810
﻿Please... get me back my brooch from that thief!

17:42.810 --> 17:44.110
﻿Rosemary!

17:44.480 --> 17:46.730
My precious brooch...

17:47.360 --> 17:49.030
﻿Now, give it back.

17:50.700 --> 17:51.450
﻿No!

17:52.620 --> 17:53.530
﻿Halt!

17:56.240 --> 17:57.580
Goodbye...

17:57.910 --> 17:59.330
﻿Fake Nadja.

18:00.790 --> 18:03.420
﻿Goodbye... forever.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.760
﻿Enough, just give it back!

18:09.720 --> 18:10.510
﻿No...

18:10.510 --> 18:11.680
﻿I don't want to get caught!

18:12.130 --> 18:15.890
﻿At least until I meet my mother... Mother, mother!

18:18.680 --> 18:20.060
﻿Wh-What is it?

18:20.600 --> 18:22.060
﻿Nadja!

18:22.060 --> 18:23.480
﻿Master!

18:24.110 --> 18:25.110
﻿Grab my hand!

18:29.610 --> 18:31.450
﻿Hey! Stop!!

18:31.450 --> 18:34.490
﻿No one stops in a situation like this!

18:35.120 --> 18:35.700
﻿Hey!!

18:35.740 --> 18:36.490
﻿Halt!

18:36.490 --> 18:37.490
﻿Stop!!!

18:38.990 --> 18:39.950
﻿Damn.

18:41.580 --> 18:44.290
﻿You! Research about that car.

18:44.290 --> 18:45.630
﻿Yes sir!

18:45.880 --> 18:48.250
﻿I won't let you go... Never!

18:49.300 --> 18:51.260
﻿Phew...! Lucky we got there in time!

18:51.760 --> 18:52.800
﻿Th-thanks.

18:52.970 --> 18:56.550
﻿I was so surprised when I woke up because you weren't there Nadja!

18:56.550 --> 19:00.520
﻿We knew where you'd go so we rushed towards this place.

19:00.680 --> 19:03.480
﻿Nadja. Don't go by yourself again.

19:03.690 --> 19:08.690
Yeah. We're friends, no, we're a family.

19:11.690 --> 19:12.610
﻿Thank you.

19:12.820 --> 19:18.530
﻿We'll have to leave Vienna once since they've brought in the police...

19:19.330 --> 19:23.460
﻿What? No! We're going to run away when we haven't done anything wrong.

19:23.460 --> 19:25.330
﻿It's not running away.

19:25.500 --> 19:27.590
﻿We're going to bring witnesses.

19:27.840 --> 19:28.840
﻿Witnesses?

19:29.420 --> 19:36.050
﻿If there are people who can prove that you're the real Nadja, they'll surely listen to us.

19:36.180 --> 19:37.010
I see.

19:37.930 --> 19:39.470
﻿That's right.

19:43.600 --> 19:48.810
﻿Hey Nadja. You didn't take off the brooch after all, did you?

19:49.190 --> 19:52.530
﻿I couldn't possibly take it off... I'm sorry.

19:53.860 --> 19:56.570
﻿I saw my mother today.

19:56.780 --> 19:57.950
﻿Your mother?!

19:58.120 --> 20:02.750
﻿But Rosemary got in the way and I couldn't get her to notice me.

20:03.370 --> 20:04.000
﻿Oh.

20:04.500 --> 20:06.040
﻿Hey Nadja.

20:06.540 --> 20:09.380
﻿How was your mother like?

20:10.040 --> 20:14.470
﻿She is the same person I met in Rome!

20:16.260 --> 20:20.300
﻿She is a great person, she is beautiful and kind, and..

20:20.680 --> 20:24.850
﻿I wished that mother would be someone like her.

20:25.270 --> 20:27.730
﻿And when I went near her she smelt really nice.

20:29.480 --> 20:31.400
﻿She was so close..

20:32.400 --> 20:34.900
﻿But in Rome I didn't have my brooch with me.

20:36.200 --> 20:39.450
﻿So I couldn't get her to realize that I am Nadja.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.200
﻿Nadja.

20:43.160 --> 20:45.250
﻿So I decided something.

20:45.580 --> 20:47.460
